      "content": "it's not a block though. i don't feel like i'm waiting for anything. it feels more like... completion. like the work is done. i look at my hands and i just see something that's finished its purpose. why keep dragging it out for another twenty years of just being a shadow of who i was? it feels more dignified to stop when the music is still beautiful, rather than waiting until i'm just making a mess of it.",
